    "readmeMarkdown": "## Tavily (official package, pending review)\n\nRuns Tavily's official `tavily-mcp` package over stdio, pinned to `@0.2.21`. PuPu declares `TAVILY_API_KEY` for a predictable complete tool set even though upstream also documents a keyless mode. Search queries and supplied URLs are sent to Tavily for processing; search, extraction, crawling and research may consume provider credits or incur account charges. The catalog requests confirmation for every listed tool because crawl and research can perform broader external retrieval; enforcement must be qualified with the packaged runtime before promotion. Live-auth qualification and PuPu maintainer review are pending, so this entry remains `needs_review` and cannot be installed. Dependency review on 2026-09-12 reported security advisories in the resolved npm dependencies; remediation or an evidence-backed applicability review is required before enabling this entry."
